Having stress in the fast life of today is a common thing but removing it is also easy .
Researchers in Japan have claimed that from a few sips of green tea throughout the day stress can be relieved .
It is significant that in many Asian countries with China and Japan green tea is used on a large scale .
According to a recently published report in an American Journal Dr . Niu and his team have conducted this test on 1058 relatively healthy older men and women .
In them in about 34 % of number of men and about 39 % of number of women symptoms of stress were present .
"Out of them total of 488 people said that they have had four or more cups throughout the day , 284 people have had two or three cups throughout the day whereas other people have consumed three one or even lesser green tea ."
"According to researchers effect of green tea was visible clearly in reduction of stress and people did not see any change in its effect despite social and economic condition , sex , diet , chronic health problems and use of stress reducing medicines ."
