Although when you develop the habit of eating a lot of food then muscles of stomach lose their natural flexibility and size of stomach actually starts increasing hence more than necessary food increases the size of stomach .
In turn this increased capacity of stomach instigates the tendency to eat more than necessary .
It is somewhat like this : If stomach is small then you will feel it to be full soon .
In people with big stomach nerves of stomach do not allow brain to suspect fulfilment until food is available in large amount hence people with a large stomach need more food to feel full which is way more than their need .
