Moving away from grains of traditional corn or roated corn people started using baby sweet corn as snacks in their food .
Its special cause has also been less calories in it and easy-to-cook and easy-to-make with being fat free .
Herbal tee :- They say that thirst for tea rings the bell of mind at its fixed time and desire for tea gets to the head but if one develops the habit of drink 8-10 cups of tea in a day then what will happen of the diet chart hence the second biggest option of tea has emerged in the form of herbal .
Many kinds of varieties have become available in herbal tea .
People especially consider herbal tea of Sri Lanka without sugar and milk as a better option meaning health also and new taste also .
