In genetic factors if the parents or some family member is fat then the child may also be fat .
If the mother - father both are fat then there remains 80 percent possibility of the child being fat and 40 percent when some one from mother - father is fat .
In children fatness begins from three years of age only .
In today `s fast life the busyness of elders has increased so much that they have started showing negligence towards the food habits of children along with themselves .
