"Deccan Development Society ( D.D.S. ) , Hyderabad got the permission from P. G. S. Organic Council of India for labeling its product as organic goods ."
"100 farmer groups have been made in Tamil Nadu , Karnataka , Maharashtra , Andhra Pradesh and Uttar Pradesh under their auspices ."
